---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { CONTACT_INFO } from '../../data/products';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | ArmXchange"
  description="Terms of service and marketplace conditions for ArmXchange shooting sports equipment catalogue."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 28px; padding-bottom: 88px; max-width: 860px;">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
      <a href="/" style="color: var(--color-ink); font-weight: 500;">Home</a> 
      <span style="color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 0.75rem;">/</span>
      <span style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Terms of Service</span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 36px;">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
        <span class="tech-badge">PLATFORM TERMS</span>
        <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;">
          OPERATING CONDITIONS
        </span>
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 2.8rem); margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-ink); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em;">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-text-body);">
        Operational and legal terms governing consultations and equipment inquiries on ArmXchange.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-card); padding: 40px 36px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px;">
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;">1. Platform Scope & Nature</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-body);">
          ArmXchange is an informational catalogue and direct coach concierge platform connecting shooting sports participants with new and pre-owned competition shooting sports equipment. The platform does not operate an automated checkout, cart, or payment gateway. All equipment transfers are coordinated following direct verification.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle); padding-top: 24px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;">2. Permitted Sporting Apparatus</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-body);">
          Listings on ArmXchange are restricted strictly to 0.177 calibre (4.5mm) target air rifles and match air pistols producing less than 20 Joules of muzzle kinetic energy (Arms Rules 2016 Category III(f)), match pellets, optical sights, and ISSF shooting gear. Firearms, live gunpowder ammunition, or non-sporting weapons are strictly prohibited.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle); padding-top: 24px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;">3. Condition Disclosures & Inspection Rights</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-body);">
          While ArmXchange exercises diligent physical verification in checking cylinder dates, velocity spreads, and disclosures, athletes are encouraged to inspect equipment in person or test fire at affiliated shooting range facilities under qualified supervision.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle); padding-top: 24px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 700;">4. Inquiries & Governance</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-body);">
          For any questions regarding platform conditions, reach out directly to founder Pranatpal Singh at {CONTACT_INFO.phoneDisplay}.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
